OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABusinesses supporting Ukraine told to  
OL,4,A'act now' to protect against Russian   
OL,5,Asabotage                               
OL,7,FAny businesses that are providing      
OL,8,Fsupport to Ukraine's armed forces,     
OL,9,Fincluding organisations in the supply  
OL,10,Fchain, have been urged to take extra   
OL,11,Fprecautions, both physically and       
OL,12,Fonline.                                
OL,14,FRussia launched its full-scale invasion
OL,15,Fof Ukraine in 2022, and there has been 
OL,16,Fa recent increase in Russian sabotage  
OL,17,Fattempts against defence related       
OL,18,Ffacilities in Europe.                  
